Subject: [PATCH] mapi32: advise sinks of a thread, utility init, property
 object copies, names, streams, compressed RTF (3230)

HrThisThreadAdviseSink with a queue per thread, HrDispatchNotifications,
ScInitMapiUtil/DeinitMapiUtil counting, IPropData CopyTo/CopyProps,
GetIDsFromNames/GetNamesFromIDs, OpenProperty as a stream, HrAddObjProps,
and WrapCompressedRTFStream (LZFu and MELA).

