+/*
+ * Compressed RTF streams (PR_RTF_COMPRESSED)
+ *
+ * Copyright 2026 Stained Glass OS
+ *
+ * The format is the one documented in MS-OXRTFCP: a header of the compressed
+ * size, the raw size, the type ("LZFu" compressed, "MELA" not) and a CRC, then
+ * the data. The compressed data is made of tokens in groups of eight, after a
+ * byte of flags: a literal byte, or a reference of 12 bits of position and 4
+ * bits of length into a dictionary of 4096 bytes that starts with a fixed text.
+ *
